'''Slashed''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by winning as murderer in [[Scary Mode]] during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its uses the same design as the [[Default Knife|Default Knife]] in the exception of the three slashed claw marks on the blade, hence the name.
